ClaraUnit:
UNIT Clara Troubadour 0x00 Level(6,NPC,True) [0,6] 0x00 0x00 0x1 REDA3R7 [Heal,Vulnerary] DoNothing // She runs in beside the party and shelters in the fort, so they can reach her before the soldiers do.
UNIT

